msgid "7. Receive events"
msgstr "7. Receive events"

#: src/interface/developers/docs/GettingStarted.tsx
msgid "The bot keeps a WebSocket connection to the gateway. Commands, button clicks, new messages and member changes arrive there as events."
msgstr "The bot keeps a WebSocket connection to the gateway. Commands, button clicks, new messages and member changes arrive there as events."

